  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math> <mi>S</mi> </math> be the set of all complex numbers <math> <mi>z</mi> </math> satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Then which of the following statements is/are TRUE?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "D9Ybf",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mrow> <mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> for all <math> <mrow> <mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow> </math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "h9pBF",
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\">   <mi>z</mi>  </mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> for all&nbsp;<math> <mrow>  <mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kpARR",
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mrow> <mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> for all <math> <mrow> <mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow> </math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kt2za",
      "text": "The set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> has exactly four elements",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8195;</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>By quadratic formula, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Option (C) is correct<br />By equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>Z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Option (B) is correct.</p>",
